{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "连续性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$e^{-1/2}$", "explanation": "由连续性可得\n$$\na=\\lim_{x\\to 0}(\\cos x)^{x^{-2}}.\n$$\n取对数，\n$$\n\\ln a=\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\ln(\\cos x)}{x^2}.\n$$\n利用 $\\ln(\\cos x)\\sim-\\dfrac{x^2}{2}$，得\n$$\n\\ln a=-\\frac12,\n$$\n故\n$$\na=e^{-1/2}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt e}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["高阶导数", "复合函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$-\\dfrac{3}{2}$", "explanation": "化简得\n$$\ny=\\frac12\\ln(1-x)-\\frac12\\ln(1+x^2).\n$$\n逐次求导并代入 $x=0$，可得\n$$\ny'''(0)=-\\frac32.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$2\\arcsin\\dfrac{\\sqrt{x}}{2}+C$", "explanation": "令\n$$\nx=4\\sin^2\\theta,\n$$\n则\n$$\ndx=8\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta,\\qquad\n\\sqrt{x(4-x)}=4\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta.\n$$\n原式化为\n$$\n\\int 2\\,d\\theta=2\\theta+C=2\\arcsin\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{2}+C.\n$$", "methods": ["换元积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["广义积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{\\pi}{8}$", "explanation": "配方得\n$$\nx^2+4x+8=(x+2)^2+2^2.\n$$\n因此\n$$\n\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x^2+4x+8}\n=\\frac12\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{dx}{\\left(\\frac{x+2}{2}\\right)^2+1}\n=\\frac12\\left[\\arctan\\frac{x+2}{2}\\right]_0^{+\\infty}\n=\\frac{\\pi}{8}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["向量组秩"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$3$", "explanation": "由秩为 $2$ 可知三向量线性相关。取三阶子式\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}\n1&2&0\\\\\n2&0&-4\\\\\n-1&t&5\n\\end{vmatrix}=0,\n$$\n化简得\n$$\n3-t=0,\n$$\n故\n$$\nt=3.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["无穷小比较", "等价无穷小"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$C$", "explanation": "由\n$$\n\\tan x=x+\\frac{x^3}{3}+o(x^3),\n$$\n得\n$$\ne^{\\tan x}-e^x=e^x\\bigl(e^{\\tan x-x}-1\\bigr)\\sim \\tan x-x\\sim \\frac{x^3}{3}.\n$$\n故它与 $x^3$ 同阶，应选 $C$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分几何意义", "凸性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$B$", "explanation": "$f'(x)<0$ 表明 $f(x)$ 单调递减，因此右端点矩形面积小于曲边梯形面积：\n$$\nS_2<S_1.\n$$\n又 $f''(x)>0$ 表明曲线为凸函数，连接端点的弦在曲线上方，所以梯形面积大于曲边梯形面积：\n$$\nS_1<S_3.\n$$\n综上\n$$\nS_2<S_1<S_3,\n$$\n故选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极值", "拐点"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$B$", "explanation": "由 $f'(x_0)=0$ 代入题设，得\n$$\nx_0f''(x_0)=1-e^{-x_0}.\n$$\n右端与 $x_0$ 同号，故\n$$\nf''(x_0)>0.\n$$\n所以 $x_0$ 为极小值点，应选 $B$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["周期函数", "定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$A$", "explanation": "被积函数 $e^{\\sin t}\\sin t$ 是以 $2\\pi$ 为周期的函数，所以\n$$\nF(x)\n$$\n与起点 $x$ 无关，是常数。又\n$$\n\\int_0^{2\\pi}e^{\\sin t}\\sin t\\,dt>0,\n$$\n故 $F(x)$ 为正常数，应选 $A$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["复合函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$D$", "explanation": "当 $x<0$ 时，$f(x)=x^2>0$，故\n$$\ng(f(x))=x^2+2.\n$$\n当 $x\\ge 0$ 时，$f(x)=-x\\le 0$，故\n$$\ng(f(x))=2-(-x)=x+2.\n$$\n因此应选 $D$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$1$", "explanation": "分子、分母同除以 $x$，并注意 $x\\to-\\infty$ 时 $|x|=-x$。于是\n$$\n\\sqrt{4x^2+x-1}=-x\\sqrt{4+\\frac1x-\\frac1{x^2}},\\qquad\n\\sqrt{x^2+\\sin x}=-x\\sqrt{1+\\frac{\\sin x}{x^2}}.\n$$\n从而原极限化为\n$$\n\\frac{\\sqrt{4+\\frac1x-\\frac1{x^2}}-1-\\frac1x}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac{\\sin x}{x^2}}}\\to 1.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["参数方程", "求导"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{(1+t^2)(y^2-e^t)}{2(1-ty)}$", "explanation": "对参数 $t$ 求导，\n$$\n\\frac{dx}{dt}=\\frac{1}{1+t^2}.\n$$\n对方程 $2y-ty^2+e^t=5$ 两边求导，得\n$$\n2\\frac{dy}{dt}-y^2-2ty\\frac{dy}{dt}+e^t=0,\n$$\n即\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt}=\\frac{y^2-e^t}{2(1-ty)}.\n$$\n因此\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt}\n=\\frac{(1+t^2)(y^2-e^t)}{2(1-ty)}.\n$$", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$e^{2x}\\tan x+C$", "explanation": "注意到\n$$\n(\\tan x+1)^2=\\tan^2x+2\\tan x+1=\\sec^2x+2\\tan x.\n$$\n而\n$$\n\\frac{d}{dx}\\bigl(e^{2x}\\tan x\\bigr)=2e^{2x}\\tan x+e^{2x}\\sec^2x\n=e^{2x}(\\tan x+1)^2.\n$$\n故原积分为\n$$\ne^{2x}\\tan x+C.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程", "齐次方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$x^3+x^2y-xy^2=C$", "explanation": "方程为齐次微分方程。令\n$$\ny=ux,\\qquad dy=u\\,dx+x\\,du,\n$$\n代入并整理后可分离变量，积分可得\n$$\nx^3+x^2y-xy^2=C.\n$$\n直接检验其微分恰与原方程对应。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y''-y'-2y=(1-2x)e^x$", "explanation": "由\n$$\ny_1-y_3=e^{-x},\\qquad y_3-y_2=e^{2x}\n$$\n知相应齐次方程有两个线性无关解 $e^{-x},e^{2x}$，其特征方程为\n$$\n(r+1)(r-2)=0,\n$$\n故齐次部分为\n$$\ny''-y'-2y=0.\n$$\n再取非齐次方程的一个特解 $y=xe^x$，代入得\n$$\ny''-y'-2y=(1-2x)e^x.\n$$\n故所求方程为\n$$\ny''-y'-2y=(1-2x)e^x.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵", "逆矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\begin{pmatrix}0&2&1\\\\0&0&0\\\\0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$", "explanation": "由\n$$\nA^2-AB=E\n$$\n得\n$$\nA(A-B)=E.\n$$\n因为 $A$ 可逆，所以\n$$\nA-B=A^{-1},\\qquad B=A-A^{-1}.\n$$\n算得\n$$\nA^{-1}=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&-1&-2\\\\\n0&1&1\\\\\n0&0&-1\n\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n从而\n$$\nB=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0&2&1\\\\\n0&0&0\\\\\n0&0&0\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["线性方程组"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "当 $\\lambda\\neq 1,-\\dfrac45$ 时有唯一解；当 $\\lambda=-\\dfrac45$ 时无解；当 $\\lambda=1$ 时有无穷多解，通解为\n$$\nx_1=1,\\quad x_2=-1+k,\\quad x_3=k\\qquad(k\\in\\mathbb R).\n$$\n", "explanation": "对增广矩阵作初等行变换，系数矩阵行列式为\n$$\n|A|=(\\lambda-1)(5\\lambda+4).\n$$\n因此：\n\n当\n$$\n\\lambda\\neq 1,-\\frac45\n$$\n时，系数矩阵可逆，方程组有唯一解。\n\n当\n$$\n\\lambda=-\\frac45\n$$\n时，化简后出现矛盾方程，故无解。\n\n当\n$$\n\\lambda=1\n$$\n时，秩小于未知量个数，故有无穷多解。化简后可取\n$$\nx_3=k,\n$$\n得到\n$$\nx_1=1,\\qquad x_2=-1+k,\\qquad x_3=k.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极坐标", "微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$x\\pm \\sqrt3\\,y=2$", "explanation": "设从 $M_0$ 到 $M$ 的弧长为\n$$\ns=\\int_0^\\theta\\sqrt{r^2+\\left(\\frac{dr}{d\\theta}\\right)^2}\\,d\\theta,\n$$\n扇形面积为\n$$\n\\frac12\\int_0^\\theta r^2\\,d\\theta.\n$$\n由题设\n$$\n\\frac12\\int_0^\\theta r^2\\,d\\theta=\\frac12 s.\n$$\n两边对 $\\theta$ 求导，得\n$$\nr^2=\\sqrt{r^2+\\left(\\frac{dr}{d\\theta}\\right)^2}.\n$$\n整理并积分，可得\n$$\n\\arccos\\frac1r=\\pm\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{3}.\n$$\n再由 $M_0(2,0)$ 代入，化为直角坐标式即\n$$\nx\\pm\\sqrt3\\,y=2.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程", "最值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$f(x)=\\dfrac a2x^3+(4-a)x$，当 $a=-5$ 时体积最小。", "explanation": "由方程\n$$\nxf'(x)-f(x)=\\frac{3a}{2}x^2\n$$\n化为\n$$\n\\left(\\frac{f(x)}{x}\\right)'=\\frac{3a}{2}.\n$$\n积分得\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac a2x^3+Cx.\n$$\n再由面积条件\n$$\n\\int_0^1 f(x)\\,dx=2\n$$\n求得\n$$\nC=4-a.\n$$\n所以\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac a2x^3+(4-a)x.\n$$\n将其代入旋转体体积公式\n$$\nV=\\pi\\int_0^1 f(x)^2\\,dx\n$$\n得到关于 $a$ 的二次函数，求极小值得\n$$\na=-5.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "proof", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["积分上限函数", "连续性", "导数定义"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "当 $x\\ne 0$ 时，\n$$\n\\varphi'(x)=\\frac{x f(x)-\\int_0^x f(u)\\,du}{x^2};\n$$\n且\n$$\n\\varphi'(0)=A,\n$$\n并且 $\\varphi'(x)$ 在 $x=0$ 处连续。", "explanation": "当 $x\\ne 0$ 时，令 $u=xt$，则\n$$\n\\varphi(x)=\\int_0^1 f(xt)\\,dt=\\frac1x\\int_0^x f(u)\\,du.\n$$\n故\n$$\n\\varphi'(x)=\\frac{x f(x)-\\int_0^x f(u)\\,du}{x^2}\\qquad(x\\ne 0).\n$$\n又由\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{f(x)}{x}=A\n$$\n可得 $f(0)=0$，进而由导数定义算得\n$$\n\\varphi'(0)=A.\n$$\n再比较\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\varphi'(x)=A=\\varphi'(0),\n$$\n故 $\\varphi'(x)$ 在 $x=0$ 处连续。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1997", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1997, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "proof", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["函数零点", "最值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1997_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1997_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "设\n$$\ng(x)=x-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\sin x,\n$$\n则它在 $\\left(0,\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$ 内有唯一极小点\n$$\nx_0=\\arccos\\frac{2}{\\pi},\n$$\n极小值\n$$\nk_0=g(x_0)=\\arccos\\frac{2}{\\pi}-\\frac12\\sqrt{\\pi^2-4}<0.\n$$\n因此：\n\n- 当 $k\\ge 0$ 或 $k<k_0$ 时，无根；\n- 当 $k=k_0$ 时，有且仅有一根；\n- 当 $k_0<k<0$ 时，有两根。", "explanation": "令\n$$\ng(x)=x-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\sin x.\n$$\n则\n$$\ng'(x)=1-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cos x.\n$$\n由 $g'(x)=0$ 得唯一驻点\n$$\nx_0=\\arccos\\frac{2}{\\pi}.\n$$\n并且\n$$\ng''(x)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\sin x>0\\qquad\\left(0<x<\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right),\n$$\n故 $x_0$ 为唯一极小点。其极小值为\n$$\nk_0=g(x_0)=\\arccos\\frac{2}{\\pi}-\\frac12\\sqrt{\\pi^2-4}<0.\n$$\n又有\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to 0^+}g(x)=0,\\qquad g\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)=0.\n$$\n于是可得：\n\n- 当 $k\\ge 0$ 或 $k<k_0$ 时，直线 $y=k$ 与曲线 $y=g(x)$ 无交点；\n- 当 $k=k_0$ 时，恰与极小点相切，故有一根；\n- 当 $k_0<k<0$ 时，有两个交点，故有两根。", "methods": []}
